#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Intellect_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "지성 특성 공개 시 말풍선 대사"
